      "body": [
        {
          "type": "TextualBody",
          "label": "Verso (seventh section of join)",
          "value": "\n<ol><li>Caesar: &ldquo;These people are Jews, and are</li>\n<li>from your people, and behold, they deal</li>\n<li>with the things of magicians. [Jud]ge them</li>\n<li>(according to) the law of the Torah, and if not&mdash;I will uproot</li>\n<li>you from the world.&rdquo;&nbsp;When</li>\n<li>R. Yehoshu\u02bfa, and Marinus the elder of the Jews,</li>\n<li>and all those who were with them heard this, they took them (i.e., Yeshu and Yoh\u0323anan),</li>\n<li>and shackled them in chains, and brought them</li>\n<li>to Tiberias. And they set up a tree for Yoh\u0323anan</li>\n<li>the Dyer, and they hung him at five hours</li>\n<li>of the day, and after this they buried him. And after him</li>\n<li>And after him they brought Yeshu the wi[cked], and wanted</li>\n<li>to hang him. And when he [saw the cr]oss</li>\n<li>standing to hang him, he d[id an act of]</li>\n<li>magi[c, and flew]</li></ol>\n",
          "format": "text/html"
        }
      ],
